#! M02 — Lantern Street. Act I "Reach": find Tobias. Teaches lamps & snuffing, the far band, relighting,
#! bodies & the canal, climb points, and the threshold rule.
#! Layout: canal quay (start, SW) → Lantern Street (E–W, gas-lit, two watch patrols) → Mother Grice's lodging-house (E).
#!   north  — the back court (dark, one lantern patrol) with drainpipes onto the roofs; the wash-house lean-to under Tobias's window.
#!   middle — Lantern Street itself: bright, wide, watched. Sergeant Pell's brazier post at the east end.
#!   south  — the coach-house yard (Institute coach, ledger), Tanner's Row and the slum roofs, The Drowned Man and its yard, the Weir dock.
#! Three routes to the window: back court + pipe, the rooftops (A → B → C → lean-to), or the side yard + pipe (behind the gas valve).
